[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 22801.03, "timestamp": "06:20:01", "text": "不能向他們免費索取藝術作品。還有一些人對自己的工作充滿熱情，他們努力在這個叫做地球的世界裡生存下去，是的，他們努力爭取佣金，努力獲得報酬，所以不能要求他們免費做"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22803.43, "timestamp": "06:20:03", "text": "這做那等等。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22817.99, "timestamp": "06:20:17", "text": "沒錯。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 22831.995, "timestamp": "06:20:31", "author": "@BreaDGuy0078", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/O8v1G-sabQKoVvPbSD8h_pLVydQ_mLyNSXpDD2A2gNJXBLHO228IzT5zq41iTuqUdmG_2xiIlg=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "90hrs on schedule 1"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22835.91, "timestamp": "06:20:35", "text": "所以那時我才意識到，有時候這是在提醒我們不要把一切都視為理所當然，對吧？無論是藝術或其他任何"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22839.548, "timestamp": "06:20:39", "text": "事物，唯獨不能用語言來表達，但凡事都有限度。不，他不應該利用朋友之間的友誼去接近另一個"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 22843.602, "timestamp": "06:20:43", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "more, bread. more"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 22848.32, "timestamp": "06:20:48", "author": "@BreaDGuy0078", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/O8v1G-sabQKoVvPbSD8h_pLVydQ_mLyNSXpDD2A2gNJXBLHO228IzT5zq41iTuqUdmG_2xiIlg=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "like how"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22857.19, "timestamp": "06:20:57", "text": "朋友。那一定是個壞朋友，對吧？但你看起來像是那種會被邀請的人嗎？  我聽什麼​​音樂？  嗯？這到底是為什麼？  這到底是為什麼？為什麼會這樣呢？這究竟是怎麼回事？為什麼？"}]